# Example cookie and proxy configuration for local testing.
# This file is used as a default placeholder when no explicit cookies file is set.
# Replace its contents with a real Netscape-format cookies file if needed.
# Example:
# .google.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	0	CONSENT	YES+
# .youtube.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	0	GPS	1

# Proxy can also be supplied via the YOUTUBE_PROXY or YT_DLP_PROXY environment variable.
# Example: http://127.0.0.1:8080
